#### Get all clubs
GET http://localhost:1337/api/clubs

#### Get club by ID
GET http://localhost:1337/api/clubs/oxt40g6l2on0n5b9yxfyafyz

#### log in
POST http://localhost:1337/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "jack@uni.edu",
  "password": "jack@uni.edu"
}

### login as ambassador
POST http://localhost:1337/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "john@uni.edu",
  "password": "john@uni.edu"
}

