### Test 1: list all users without auth (needs Public > Users > find)
GET http://localhost:1337/api/users

### Test 2: list users with role populated (no auth)
GET http://localhost:1337/api/users?populate=role

### Test 3: list users with role populated (with ambassador JWT)
GET http://localhost:1337/api/users?populate=role
